'' The TARGET decides the layout, and -target must actually reach it. It did not:
'' the type context is built before the command line is parsed, so 'targetName' was
'' written and read by nothing, and every compilation used the host's layout.
'' Every number here is measured from fbc for that target.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-types -target win32 tests/source/plain.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: pointer=32 bits, wchar=2 bytes, string=12 bytes align 4
